  <section id="how-it-works" class="tyov-landing__section" aria-labelledby="tyov-process-title">
    <p class="tyov-kicker">One Prompt. Two kinds of record.</p>
    <h2 id="tyov-process-title">Write what happened. Distill what remains.</h2>
    <div class="tyov-process">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Consult the book</h3><p>Enter only the Prompt number and encounter count. The physical book remains your guide.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Keep the journal</h3><p>Write the full response in the vampire’s voice, then capture its meaning as one evocative Experience.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Change the record</h3><p>Assign the Experience to a Memory and record what the Prompt created, checked, changed, or took away.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tyov-landing__section tyov-landing__section--memory" aria-labelledby="tyov-memory-title">
    <div>
      <p class="tyov-kicker">The shape of forgetting</p>
      <h2 id="tyov-memory-title">Nothing lost is erased.</h2>
      <p>The private Chronicle keeps active Memories, frozen Diary Memories, and forgotten Experiences distinct. Struck-through traits remain legible so an absence can keep influencing the story.</p>
    </div>
